{"version":1,"content":"\n<p>CosmoKnowledgeMap 是一款將 Safari 網頁與筆記轉化為 3D 知識星圖的個人知識管理工具，適合經常蒐集資料、整理研究或建立學習筆記的人士。原價 US $0.99，現正<a href=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/category/apps-%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/%E9%99%90%E6%99%82%E5%85%8D%E8%B2%BB%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">限時免費</a>。</p>\n<figure><img alt=\"限時免費\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"460\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/460x460Icon-Ap-SiOS01-75-154.webp\" width=\"460\"/></figure>\n<h2>知識星圖與全文搜尋</h2>\n<p>可從 Safari 擴展、分享表單或手動收集網頁與筆記，以全文搜尋定位後跳至星圖節點，沿連線探索關聯。提供四種視圖切換；選取主題可生成文字，讓使用者自行貼到 ChatGPT、Claude 或 Gemini 再匯回，新增 30、100 或 200 個項目，無需 API key 或額外付款。每個筆記本可設獨立數字密碼，支援 Face ID 或 Touch ID；內建日本星圖樣本與宇宙坍縮模式，資料儲存於裝置。</p>\n<figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1290x2796bb-137-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1181\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1290x2796bb-138-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1181\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1320x2868bb-427-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1178\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1320x2868bb-428-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1178\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1320x2868bb-429-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1178\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1320x2868bb-430-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1178\"/></figure></figure>\n<ul><li>應用名稱：CosmoKnowledgeMap</li><li>應用類別：Productivity</li><li>下載位置：<a href=\"https://apps.apple.com/app/cosmoknowledgemap/id6805659873?uo=4\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">App Store</a></li></ul>\n","scraped_at":"2026-11-01T03:38:14.030991+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":373,"images":7,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-30T22:33:16+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-01T04:17:57.795756+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-01T03:31:41.464222+00:00","content_hash":"f72467eb13dcda6670c9aac82dba37cb98333b4c5aeb2846f62776c06b88379e","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-01T03:38:14.030991+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}